SOAPBOX: Second time for me to take part in 160m CW contest as SP5GAN.
SOAPBOX: This time, I could take part a few hours only (holiday style).
SOAPBOX: Antenna is a 20 meter end-fed wire, sloping from 7th floor of building.
SOAPBOX: Rig used is homemade CW-QRP-TRX.
SOAPBOX: Heavy noisy urban environment. TX-pwr: 4 Watts QRP only. IF-BW: 400Hz.
SOAPBOX: My QRA: KO02MD
SOAPBOX: I was happy to see how patiently so many ops picked up my weak signal!
SOAPBOX: Thanks to all who did so and encouraged me to be qrv on 160 meters.
SOAPBOX: I was able to contact 13 European countries, 58 QSQs in total.
SOAPBOX: Learn more about me at www.qrz.com. (look for SP5GAN and/or DL2GAN)
SOAPBOX: Hope to hear you again in 2027! Dood DX & Happy brasspounding!
SOAPBOX: Wx: Misty and foggy, light snowfall, nighttime temperature around -5°C.
